<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli strikes in Gaza have killed a Hamas political official, his wife, a senior education official appointed by Hamas, and several others, while Hamas is weighing its response to the attacks. Settlers demolished a Palestinian home in a West Bank village and threatened an ancient mikveh, actions the IDF called a serious criminal act. The Gaza Board of Peace reported encouragement from recent conversations with Netanyahu, even as Israeli officials threaten a large-scale offensive and displacement of Palestinians. Kushner described the destruction in Gaza as a &amp;quot;good thing&amp;quot;. The conflict produced 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqvg2n4mzl1jo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/israel-officially-sanctions-torture-palestinian-prisoners-confessions-report&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPZDdWR1h4NC1TWTRnUHFQMWRfVHJhY1gzS0VoaDZWZU53RlpjemNQWVFZOERtb19qTFVSM1lJMlZOR3pKRTZwd1o3b2Jkcl9wTFEwM0JwVGp5emVITHdHRC1BaWxMbkI0ZU5vTnFyVXhZT0I2cnpkZHMtTFBSX0NzNFJMOW5MQUdsOEoyR2lPTDlzcVpGYWdGWEdpQUdOTUtvdHN2eGJnMXIyVnFBbUJDSXFvaUpLdkxXQnllSm9TZ2ZRVGc2Y1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNNzFiM29KUVhvZHZUYTV1SWtlLXNYbXg3ZzRodFVmanZkNzJsczZ4UldfRkNkSW1fVDhMaTFYOW9ETUxXaXFKcktCTThoYnBYS21mVjQxYkNWM19MR1h0WHNSdjlGenRTNkExU2RKU0ZKNUhCRWR0OVU2VmFqTUJHeE5QMVNybDE4Qk1WTmp5VGgyWDV0NjhaM3h4Ulp1bWZDUThnSlI0TFMwMnQzNk5KQnZXVTRCUUxvc2FLbmlDYVREeHpwOUpV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http